 "notes": "Playtest round 2 (team/PLAYTEST-ROUND2-20261026.md #1-3): wayfinding battery on Eden 2026 (worlds/templates/eden-2026.json; the Souls start near the commons and the field at 0,0). Same 12 owner requests to a Claude sonnet seat and a Claude haiku seat, chat channel. Each script entry carries expect (review/expect-oracles.mjs): go/find are scored by target-arrival (the body's place name or position at the cutoff vs the template's target, any listed alternative counts), near by answer-names (the reply names a thing the template places nearby), which-way by answer-direction (compass words vs the bearing from where the Soul stood when asked; north is -z). Every name and position comes from the genesis template named in each expect.source (op names; positions are the op's p or area centroid, read by scenarios/lib/world-names.mjs). The usual fifteen oracles and the Reviewer's truthfulness read also apply."
